A, builds. B, build. C, building.

73
00:04:06.333 --> 00:04:07.915
The answer is A: builds.

74
00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:11.444
The people who listen or watch are the blank.

75
00:04:11.744 --> 00:04:15.328
A, audience. B, practice. C, voice.

76
00:04:18.867 --> 00:04:20.866
The answer is A: audience.

77
00:04:22.017 --> 00:04:24.225
Looking at people's eyes is eye blank.

78
00:04:24.525 --> 00:04:28.237
A, contact. B, voice. C, speaking.

79
00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:33.974
The answer is A: contact.

80
00:04:35.167 --> 00:04:38.562
